Source: nonla-apt-source
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Le Hung Quang Minh <nonlaproject@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: nonla-apt-source
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nonla-repo-keyring
Description: nonlaOS APT repository source entry
 Installs the deb822 APT source entry used to fetch nonlaOS packages and
 updates from the official nonlaOS repository.
 .
 The repository URI is supplied at build time so the public domain is not
 hardcoded in the source tree. Builds without a configured URI ship a disabled
 placeholder entry that APT ignores until an administrator fills it in.
